b1 Be6 25. Rxg7+ {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'which lead to very unclear position,as King in the center is placed not bad at all.' which lead to very unclear position,as King in the center is placed not bad at all.} Qxg7 26. Rxg7+ Kxg7 27. Qg3+ Kh8 (27... Kf6 28. Qd6 Kg7 29. Nxd5) 28. Qe5+ Kg8 29. Qg5+ Kh8 30. Qf6+ {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'led to very unpleasant position with the King in the center.' led to very unpleasant position with the King in the center.} Kg8 31. Ne2) 21... Kh8 22. Bf4 (22. Bd4 Bxd4 (22... f6 {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'preparing f7-f5 later.' preparing f7-f5 later.} {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'stronger was' stronger was} 23. Rxg3 Qxd5 24. Bxf6) 23. Qxd4+ f6) 22... Qg6 23. Qd2 (23. Qf3 Bf5 24. Rxg3 Qc6) 23... Bxh3 24. Rxg3 $1 Bg4 {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'Diagram ' Diagram [#]} 25. Rh1 $1 {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'Destroying the opponents structure in the center and opening the position,while Blacks Knight is out of action.' Destroying the opponents structure in the center and opening the position,while Blacks Knight is out of action.} Rfe8 26. Ne3 Qe4 (26... Qf6 27. Nxg4 Qxb2+ 28. Kd1 Rad8 29. Rd3) (26... f5 27. Qh2 {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'and three pawns will become dangerous sooner or later.' and three pawns will become dangerous sooner or later.} {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'nothig would give' nothig would give} Kg8) 27. Qh2 Be6 (27... Bf5 28. Rxg7 Kxg7 29. Nxf5+ {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'but the advantage is minimal.' but the advantage is minimal.} Qxf5 {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'to very sharp play led the piece sacrifice' to very sharp play led the piece sacrifice} 30. Nd4) 28. Rxg7 (28. Nd2) 28... Kxg7 29. Qh6+ $1 {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'Passed pawns function is to go forward.' Passed pawns function is to go forward.} Kg8 (29... Kh8 30. Be5+) 30. Rg1+ Qg6 31. Rxg6+ fxg6 32. Nd4 Rad8 33. Be5 Rd7 34. Nxe6 Rxe6 35. Ng4 Rf7 36. Qg5 Rf1+ 37. Kd2 h5 $1 {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'was the only chance to create own counterplay.' was the only chance to create own counterplay.} {MIKHALCHISHIN: 'Possible was' Possible was} 38. Qd8+ (38. Qd8+ Rf8 39. Nh6+) 1-0

