{Game 31: 'The next game covers the main line of the ...Nc6-variation.'} 1. e4 {Ftacnik,Lubomir Ftacnik,Lubomir Ftacnik,Lubomir Ftacnik,Lubomir: 'Ftacnik,L'} c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d3 Nc6 4. g3 g6 (4... d5 $1 5. Nbd2 Nf6 6. Bg2 Be7 7. O-O O-O 8. Qe2 b5) 5. Bg2 Bg7 6. O-O Nge7 7. Re1 (7. c3 {Emms reaches this position in a note and gives Black's last move an exclam, but modern engines show a refutation:}) 7... d6 (7... O-O $5 8. e5) 8. c3 O-O 9. d4 (9. Na3 $18 {when Black has no defence against the attack on the kingside.}) 9... cxd4 (9... b6) 10. cxd4 $1 d5 (10... Qb6 11. d5 Nd4 (11... Bxb2 $16 12. Bxb2 $2 Qxb2 {If} 13. dxc6 ({or} 13. Nbd2 Na5 14. Qa4 Qb6 15. e5 Nxd5 $1 {with a winning attack} 16. exd6 $2 {is surprisingly just lost after} Qd8) 13... Qxa1 14. Qb3 {White has:} Nxc6 $1 15. Nc3 Nd4 16. Rxa1 Nxb3 17. axb3 Bd7 {Black is defenceless.}) 12. Nc3 exd5 13. exd5 Nxf3+ 14. Qxf3 $1 Nf5 15. Ne4 Nd4 16. Qd3 $16 {Moll - Punzon Moraleda, email 2009.} Bf5 17. Be3 Qxb2 18. Rad1 Nc2 19. Re2 $1 Rac8) 11. e5 Bd7 (11... f6 12. Nc3 fxe5 13. dxe5 a6 14. Bf4 Bd7 15. Qd2 Rc8 16. Rac1 b5 $5 17. Ne2 Qa5 18. Qxa5 Nxa5 19. Ned4 h6 20. h4 Nac6 21. Nb3 Rfd8 $44 {Inkiov-Vera/Varna/1986/} 22. Nc5 $1 Nb4 23. a3 $14 Rxc5 24. Rxc5 Nd3 25. Rc7 Nxb2 26. Nd4) 12. Nc3 Rc8 (12... Qb6 {Game 31: ''} 13. Na4 $2 Qc7 $18 14. Bg5 $6 Rfc8 $17) 13. Bf4 {Game 31: 'transposes to our main game.'} Na5 14. Rc1 b5 $6 15. b3 $1 b4 16. Ne2 Bb5 (16... Rxc1 $5 17. Nxc1 $2 Bb5 18. Nd3 $2 Bxd3 $1 $19 {Game 31: 'Of course the simple tactical point is:'} 19. Qxd3) 17. Qd2 Nac6 (17... Bxe2 18. Qxe2 Qb6 (18... Rxc1 19. Rxc1 Qb6 $16 20. Qc2 $5 Rc8 21. Qxc8+ Nxc8 22. Rxc8+ Bf8 23. Bh6 $14)) 18. g4 a5 $6 (18... Bxe2 19. Qxe2 $14 Qb6 20. Be3 Nb8 21. Bf1 $1) 19. Ng3 Qb6 20. h4 Nb8 (20... Rc7 21. Bh6) 21. Bh6 Nd7 22. Qg5 $1 (22. Bxg7 $16 Kxg7 23. g5 (23. h5) 23... Nf5) 22... Rxc1 23. Rxc1 Bxh6 24. Qxh6 $1 Rc8 (24... f6 25. Qe3) 25. Rxc8+ Nxc8 26. h5 Qd8 (26... Ne7 $18) (26... Nf8) 27. Ng5 (27. hxg6 hxg6 28. Ng5 Nf8) 27... Nf8 28. Be4 (28. hxg6 fxg6 29. Nxh7 Nxh7 30. Qxg6+ Kh8 $18 31. Qxe6) 28... Qe7 (28... dxe4 29. N3xe4 $16 Qe7 (29... Nd6 30. hxg6) 30. Nf6+ Kh8 31. Ngxh7 $1) (28... Qc7 29. hxg6 fxg6 30. Qxf8+ $1 Kxf8 31. Nxe6+ $1 $18 Ke7 $2 32. Nxc7 $1 dxe4 33. Nxb5 Kd7) (28... Be8 29. hxg6 fxg6 $13) 29. Nxh7 (29. Bh1) 29... Nxh7 30. hxg6 fxg6 (30... Nf8 31. g7) (30... dxe4 31. Qxh7+ Kf8 32. Qh8#) 31. Bxg6 Ng5 (31... Nf8 32. Nh5 Nd7 33. Be8 $1) (31... Be8 32. Bxh7+ Qxh7 33. Qxe6+ Kf8 34. Qxc8 Qb1+ 35. Kg2 Qxa2 36. Nf5 $18) (31... Qg7 32. Bxh7+ Kf8 33. Qxe6 $1 $18 Bd7 34. Qxd5 $18 Qxh7) 32. Nh5 Nf3+ 33. Kg2 $1 Nh4+ 34. Kg3 Nxg6 35. Nf6+ Kf7 36. Qh7+ (36. Qh7+ Kf8 37. Qg8#) 1-0

