{[%evp 0,19,19,38,40,41,66,66,57,33,33,27,50,61,74,51,40,57,70,52,40,15]} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bc4 e6 7. O-O (7. Bb3 Be7 8. O-O O-O 9. f4 Nbd7 10. f5 e5 11. Nde2 b5 12. Nd5 Bb7 13. Nec3 Nc5 14. Nxf6+ Bxf6 15. Bd5 Bxd5 16. Nxd5 h6 17. Qg4 Kh7 18. Rf3 Rc8 19. Rh3 Nd7 20. Qh5 Rc4 21. Bxh6 g6 22. fxg6+ fxg6 23. Qg4 Rf7 24. Rf1 Rxc2 25. Bf8+) 7... b5 8. Bb3 b4 9. Nb1 (9. Na4 Bd7 10. f4 (10. c3 Nc6 11. Re1 Rb8 12. f3 Be7 13. Nxc6 Bxc6 14. cxb4 Rxb4 15. Be3 O-O 16. Rc1 Bd7 17. Re2) (10. Be3) 10... Nc6 11. f5 e5 12. Nf3 (12. Ne6) 12... h6 (12... Be7 13. Bg5 Nxe4 14. Qd5 Nxg5 15. Nxg5) 13. Qe1 (13. c3) 13... Be7 14. Qg3 Kf8 15. Qe1 Rb8 16. Bd2 (16. a3 Na5 (16... a5 17. axb4 axb4 18. Bc4) 17. axb4 Nxb3 18. cxb3 Bc6 19. Nc3) 16... Qe8 17. a3 a5 18. Kh1 Kg8 19. Rg1 (19. axb4 axb4 20. Bc4 Na5) (19. h3) 19... bxa3 (19... Kh7 20. g4 Nd4 21. Nxd4 exd4 22. g5 hxg5 23. Rxg5 Kg8 (23... Bc6 24. Qh4+ Kg8 25. Rxg7+) 24. Rxg7+ Kxg7 25. Qg3+ Kf8 26. Rg1 Ng4 27. Qxg4 Bf6) 20. Rxa3 Nd4 (20... d5 21. exd5 Bxa3 22. dxc6 Bxc6 23. Nxe5) 21. Nxd4 exd4 22. Ra1 Bc6 23. Bxa5 Nxe4 24. Rf1 h5 25. Nb6 h4 26. Bd5 (26. Nd5 Bg5) 26... Bg5 27. Rf3 h3 (27... Rxb6 28. Qxe4) 28. Bxc6 (28. g3 Rxb6) 28... Qxc6 29. Qe2 Bf4 30. Kg1 (30. Rxf4 Ng3+ 31. hxg3 hxg2+ 32. Kg1 Rh1+ 33. Kf2 Rxa1) 30... Be3+ 31. Kh1 Re8 32. Qc4 Nf2+ 33. Rxf2 Qxc4 (33... Qe4 34. Rf3 hxg2+ 35. Kxg2 Rxh2+ 36. Kxh2 Qxf3) 34. Nxc4 Bxf2 35. Nxd6 Re2 36. b4 Bg3 37. gxh3 Bxd6) 9... Bd7 10. Be3 $6 {Too circumspect move. Better was any developing move.} Nc6 11. f3 Be7 12. c3 bxc3 $6 13. Nxc6 $6 Bxc6 $2 14. Nxc3 $18 O-O 15. Rc1 Qb8 16. Nd5 exd5 17. Rxc6 dxe4 18. fxe4 Qb5 (18... Nxe4 {the position is unclear.} {This sharp move leads to an unclear play. Preferable was} 19. Rxf7 $16 (19. Bd5) 19... Rxf7 {was preferable.} 20. Bxf7+ {was interesting.} {Interesting is} Kxf7 21. Qd5+ {is the alternative.} {At the time this game was played, the game move was more popular than} Kf8 {Fischer more often played} 22. Qxe4 {The Sozin attack.}) 19. Rb6 Qe5 20. Bd4 Qg5 (20... Qxe4 21. Re1) 21. Qf3 Nd7 22. Rb7 Ne5 23. Qe2 Bf6 24. Kh1 a5 25. Bd5 Rac8 26. Bc3 a4 27. Ra7 Ng4 28. Rxa4 Bxc3 29. bxc3 Rxc3 (29... Ne3 $5 {was more cautious.} {This move loses. After a better} 30. Qd2 h6 31. Rc1 Rfe8) 30. Rxf7 Rc1+ 31. Qf1 h5 32. Qxc1 Qh4 33. Rxf8+ Kh7 34. h3 Qg3 35. hxg4 h4 {was stronger.} 36. Be6 $5 1-0

