{Bobby Fischer: 'GAME N. 52 Peekaboo strategy. The MacCutcheon Variation gives rise to unusual positions where White is frequently obliged to forfeit the privilege of castling in order to try and wrest an advantage. After some slight but instructive opening inexactitudes on both sides, Rossolimo appears to achieve equality. Indeed. he is constantly on the brink of crashing through with a counter-attack against White's vulnerable King, although his own monarch is also stranded in the center. After 13. ... f5. which shores up his fortress, it's not clear just whose attack will come first. In a theoretically important formation - a logical. offshoot of this variation - Fischer unearths two fine moves (17 Bb5 + and 19. Ng 1) to sustain his flagging initiative. Still, he is forced to wage a running battle. no sooner landing a blow than having to duck. Consequently, the outcome is in doubt until the very last punch. '} 1. e4 {Belov Belov Bobby Fischer} e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. e5 c5 {Bobby Fischer: 'Mac Cutcheon,n'} 5. a3 Bxc3+ 6. bxc3 Ne7 7. Nf3 Bd7 8. a4 Qa5 9. Qd2 Nbc6 10. Bd3 c4 {Bobby Fischer: 'Position after'} 11. Be2 f6 12. Ba3 {Bobby Fischer: 'Position after'} O-O-O 13. O-O Nf5 $1 $10 {Bobby Fischer: '=!' Bobby Fischer: 'Re-establishing parity.'} 14. Rfe1 ({Bobby Fischer: 'NO BETTER IS...'} 14. g4) 14... Be8 (14... h5) (14... fxe5 $18 {WINS.}) 15. g4 Nfe7 $6 {Bobby Fischer: '?'} 16. Bf1 Bd7 {Bobby Fischer: 'Position after'} 17. Bh3 {Bobby Fischer: '!'} h6 $6 {Bobby Fischer: '?'} 18. Bd6 {Bobby Fischer: 'Mission accomplished. Now Black's King is pinioned to the K-side'} Rdf8 19. Rab1 $1 $16 { h3-f4/  h3-f4/ Bobby Fischer: '!' Bobby Fischer: 'The key move. This Knight is headed for f4 where it can exert maximum pressure on the g-Pawn..'} Rf7 20. exf6 gxf6 {Bobby Fischer: '!?' Bobby Fischer: 'Quite rightly. Rossolimo prefers active defense. After Position after 21'} 21. Bg3 Ng6 22. Rb5 $1 Qa6 ({ON..} 22... Qxa4 {Bobby Fischer} 23. Rbb1 $1 Qa5 24. Ra1 Qd8 25. Ra2) 23. Reb1 b6 24. Qc1 (24. Nh4 $10 {Bobby Fischer: 'HOLDS.'}) 24... Qxa4 25. R5b2 {Bobby Fischer: '!'} Qa3 26. Qe3 Kb7 27. Nh4 Nxh4 28. Bxh4 e5 (28... h5) (28... Qf8) (28... Ka8) 29. dxe5 $18 fxe5 (29... d4 30. Qf4) 30. Rxb6+ $1 Ka8 ({AFTER,} 30... axb6 {Bobby Fischer} 31. Qxb6+ $18 {contains too many threats.}) ({Bobby Fischer: 'Overprotecting the Bishop. After the hasty'} 30... Kc8 $2 31. Rxc6+ $1 Bxc6 32. Qxe5) 31. R6b5 Be6 32. Bg3 $1 {Bobby Fischer: '' Bobby Fischer: 'No credit for other moves!'} {Bobby Fischer: 'Final Position after,'} e4 {Bobby Fischer: '' Bobby Fischer: 'Black resigns IF'} (32... Qd6 $18 {Bobby Fischer: 'etc. A hard-fought game!'}) 33. Qxh6 Rxh6 (33... Re8 34. Qxe6) 34. Rb8+ 1-0

