1. d4 {Gligoric: I remember very little about the ten games which Bobby and I played, except that I won as White in the final game.  I think that Bobby had at least three wins. If I had kept my easily readable score-sheets, we would have no problems today, but after the match I gave them all to Bobby, without his asking, to show him that the material would never be used for any publicity purposes.} Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. Nf3 O-O 6. Be2 e5 7. O-O Nc6 8. d5 Ne7 9. Nd2 a5 10. a3 Bd7 (10... Nd7 {La grande ligne} 11. Rb1 f5 12. b4) 11. b3 c5 12. Rb1 b6 13. b4 axb4 $146 (13... Nc8 14. bxa5 Rxa5 15. a4 Ne8 16. Nb3 Ra8 17. Bd2 f5 18. f3 Nf6 19. Ra1 f4 20. a5 bxa5 21. Nb5 a4 22. Qe1 Bxb5 23. cxb5 Nb6 24. Na5 Nfd7 25. Bd1 Qc7 26. Bxa4 Nxa4 27. Rxa4 Rfb8 28. Qe2 {Danielian,O-Brenjo,S (2320)/Leningrad 1991/CBM 023 ext/½-½ (50)}) 14. axb4 Bh6 {Une manoeuvre souvent jouée par Bobby dans ce match mais c'est intrinsèquement risqué car même en échangeant le bon  des Blancs, les Noirs affaiblissement leur position si les Blancs arrivent à jouer la poussée f2f4} (14... Ne8 $142 15. bxc5 (15. Qb3)) 15. bxc5 bxc5 16. Nb3 Bxc1 17. Qxc1 Nc8 18. Ra1 (18. Qe3 Ne8 19. Nxc5 dxc5 20. Qxc5 Ncd6 21. Qe3 f5 22. c5 $13) 18... Rb8 19. Ra3 Rb4 20. Qe3 Nb6 21. Nd2 (21. Nxc5 $5 dxc5 22. Qxc5 Rb2 23. Qe3 Qc7 24. c5 $44) 21... Ng4 22. Bxg4 Bxg4 23. f4 $1 {[%csl Rg7]} exf4 24. Qxf4 Rb2 25. Ra7 (25. e5 $1 dxe5 26. Qh6 {[%cal Gd2e4,Ge4f6]}) 25... Bd7 26. Nf3 f6 {[%csl Re6]} (26... Nxc4 27. e5 {[%cal Gc3e4,Ge4f6]} Nxe5 28. Nxe5 dxe5 29. Qxe5 {[%cal Ge5b2,Gc3e4]} Re8 30. Qc7 (30. Qf4 Bf5) 30... Qg5) 27. Qxd6 $2 Rxg2+ $1 {[%cal Gd7h3,Gd8d6]} 28. Kh1 Rc2 29. Nd1 Bh3 $40 30. Qxd8 Rxd8 31. Ne3 Bxf1 32. Nxc2 Nxc4 33. Na3 Nd6 34. e5 Be2 35. Ng1 (35. Kg2 Bxf3+ 36. Kxf3 fxe5) 35... Bd3 $19 36. Nh3 fxe5 37. Ng5 h6 38. Ne6 Rc8 39. Rg7+ Kh8 40. Rd7 Nb5 41. d6 c4 42. Nd8 Be4+ 43. Kg1 Bd5 0-1

