sthenics: 'Bulletin: '!''} (23. Rh3 $2 Rc8 $17) 23... Rxh5 24. Qg2 Rh8 25. Rc3 Rc8 (25... Qd6 $142 $5 $11) 26. b4 Be3+ 27. Kb1 Qb6 28. Rxc8+ Kxc8 29. Qf3 (29. Qa8+ Kc7 30. Qf8 Qd6 $1 31. Qxf7+ Qd7 32. Qxd7+ Kxd7 $14) 29... Kd8 {ChessCalisthenics: '?' '?'} (29... Bf2 $142 $5 $14) 30. h4 Ke7 {ChessCalisthenics: '??' '??'} (30... e5 $142 31. h5 Bxf4 32. Nxf4 exf4 $18) 31. h5 f5 (31... Kf8 $2 32. h6 Kg8 33. Qg3+) (31... Bd2 32. h6 Qd8 $18) 32. h6 Bd4 33. Nxd4 Qxd4 34. Qh1 $1 {ChessCalisthenics: 'Bulletin: '!''} (34. h7 $2 Qg1+ 35. Kb2 Qh2 36. Qb7+ Kf6) 34... Qh8 35. h7 Kf8 (35... e5 36. fxe5 f4 $18) 36. Qa8+ Kg7 37. Qxh8+ Kxh8 38. c4 Kxh7 (38... bxc4 39. a4 e5 40. b5 axb5 41. axb5 exf4 42. b6 Kxh7 43. b7 $18) 39. c5 1-0

