1. Nf3 {ChessBase II ChessBase II ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar'} Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. b3 Bg7 4. Bb2 O-O 5. g3 d6 6. Bg2 e5 7. O-O Nc6 8. Nc3 Nh5 9. e3 ({Our main move order is} 9. d3 f5 10. e3) 9... f5 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '=''} 10. d3 g5 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '?!''} (10... f4 $5 {[%cal Gh5f4,Gc8g4] ChessBase II}) 11. Ne1 {This anticipates Black's massive attack, but commits the knight a bit too soon.} g4 12. f3 (12. f4 exf4 13. gxf4 (13. exf4 Bd4+ 14. Kh1 Qf6 {[%csl Gc3][%cal Gh5g3]}) 13... Ne7 {[%cal Gc7c6,Ge7g6]}) 12... Nf6 $6 {This justifies White's previous move.} (12... Ne7 13. fxg4 fxg4 14. Rxf8+ Qxf8 15. Nc2 c6 16. Qd2 Qf6 17. Rf1 Qh6 18. Ne4 $16 {Spraggett,K (2580)-Zapata,A (2515) Cienfuegos 1997 (1-0, 46)}) (12... gxf3 13. Nxf3 Nf6 14. Nh4 $16) (12... Qg5 $1 {was called for, even though Black more or less wastes a tempo.} 13. f4 (13. Qe2 f4) (13. Qd2 f4) (13. fxg4 Qxe3+ 14. Kh1 fxg4 15. Rxf8+ Bxf8 16. Nd5 Qh6 17. Kg1 (17. Nxc7 Nxg3+ 18. Kg1 Qe3#) 17... Qg7 $13 {White surely has some compensation for the missing pawn, due to his advance in development and the weakness of the f5-square, but Black should be OK.}) 13... exf4 14. gxf4 ({Only not} 14. exf4 $6 Bd4+ 15. Kh1 $2 Nxg3+ 16. hxg3 Qh6+) 14... Qd8 15. Nc2 Ne7 $132 {The position is quite interesting, but the relative lack of safety of the white king is a bit annoying.}) 13. f4 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '''} Ne7 14. Qd2 Ng6 15. Nd5 Ne8 16. Rd1 c6 17. Nc3 exf4 18. exf4 h5 19. Nc2 h4 20. Rfe1 $14 Nf6 21. Ne2 Bd7 22. Bd4 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '!''} Rf7 23. Bf2 h3 24. Bh1 Qc7 25. Nc3 a6 26. Nd4 {[%csl Re6] ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '''} Nf8 27. b4 Rd8 28. Nb3 Re8 29. Rxe8 Bxe8 30. a4 Kh7 31. Ne2 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '?''} (31. b5 $1 {(ChessBase II) Matanovic,Aleksandar}) 31... Re7 32. a5 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '?!''} Kg6 33. Nc3 Bf7 34. Re1 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '''} Rd7 {[%cal Gd6d5]} (34... Ne6) 35. Qc2 d5 36. Bb6 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '?!''} (36. Nc5 {(ChessBase II) Matanovic,Aleksandar}) 36... Qc8 (36... Re7 $1 37. Bxc7 Rxe1+ 38. Kf2 Rxh1 $44 {[%csl Rc2,Rf2,Rh2][%cal Gh1h2]}) 37. Ne2 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '?!''} dxc4 38. dxc4 Re7 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '''} 39. Bc5 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '?!''} (39. Bf2 {(ChessBase II) Matanovic,Aleksandar} Ne4 40. Ned4 $15) 39... Re8 40. Bf2 (40. Rd1 Ne6 41. Bf2 $11) 40... Ne4 41. Bd4 Bxd4+ 42. Nexd4 Nd6 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '!''} 43. Re5 $6 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '?''} (43. Rxe8 Qxe8 44. Kf2 Bxc4 45. Nxf5 $1 Nxf5 (45... Bxb3 $2 46. Nxd6+) 46. Qxc4 Qe3+ 47. Kf1) 43... Rxe5 44. fxe5 Qe8 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '-+!''} 45. Qe2 Bxc4 46. Qe3 Bxb3 47. Nxb3 Nc4 48. Qe2 Nxe5 49. Nc5 Qe7 {ChessBase II: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '!''} 50. Nxb7 Nfd7 51. Qd2 Nc4 52. Qc3 Qe2 53. Bxc6 Nd2 54. Qc1 Ne5 0-1

