{[%evp 0,23,19,28,37,-2,3,-15,-8,-15,13,-15,-33,-37,-26,-13,-9,-17,-21,-93,-48,-10,13,-42,-143,-124]} 1. e4 e5 2. f4 exf4 3. Bc4 Nf6 ({The alternative is} 3... Qh4+) 4. Nc3 c6 5. d4 Bb4 6. e5 $6 ({Unnecessary move. Better was} 6. Nge2 $11 {after which the position is even.}) 6... Ne4 7. Qh5 O-O ({Stronger was} 7... g6) 8. Nge2 d5 9. Bb3 ({Bishop is more active on d3} 9. Bd3 $13) 9... g6 10. Qh6 Bg4 $6 ({Better was an active} 10... f6 {and after} 11. O-O Bxc3 12. Rxf4 Bd2 $13 {the position is unclear.}) 11. Bd2 $2 ({The mistake which leads to a losing position. Better was} 11. O-O) 11... Nxd2 $19 12. Kxd2 g5 $2 ({Fischer was too young to be able to find a winning line:} 12... Bxe2 13. Kxe2 f6 $19 {The game move is so bad that it leads to a losing position.}) 13. h4 $1 $18 {White's attack is unstopable.} gxh4 ({Neither} 13... Bf5 {can help} 14. hxg5 Bg6 15. Rh3 $18) 14. Rxh4 Bf5 15. Rah1 Be7 16. Rg4+ $1 Bg6 17. Qxh7# 1-0

