{Dies war Fischers erste Partie mit der "Poisoned Pawn" Variante. Sie ging auch fast ins Auge.} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bg5 e6 7. f4 Qb6 8. Qd2 Qxb2 9. Rb1 Qa3 10. Bxf6 gxf6 11. Be2 Nc6 12. Nb3 Bg7 13. f5 (13. O-O f5 14. exf5 Qb4 15. Nd1 Qxd2 16. Nxd2 Nd4 17. Bd3 Nxf5 18. Bxf5 exf5 19. Nc4 Be6 20. Nde3 O-O-O 21. Rfd1 Kc7 22. Nd5+ Kb8 23. a4 Rhe8 24. a5 Bxd5 25. Rxd5 Re4 26. Rxd6 Bd4+ 27. Kh1 Rde8 28. Ne5 Bxe5 29. fxe5 R4xe5 30. h3 R8e7 {Rossetto,H-Panno,O/Mar del Plata 1962 (30)}) 13... O-O 14. O-O Ne5 15. Nd4 b5 16. Kh1 Bd7 17. Bh5 Rac8 18. Rb3 Qc5 19. Nce2 Nc4 20. Qc1 e5 21. Rg3 Kh8 22. Rxg7 Kxg7 23. Rf3 Rg8 24. Rg3+ Kf8 25. Qh6+ Ke7 26. Qxh7 exd4 27. Qxf7+ Kd8 28. Rxg8+ Kc7 29. Nf4 Qa3 30. Nd5+ Kb8 31. h4 Ne3 32. Rxc8+ (32. Qxd7 Qc1+ 33. Kh2 Nf1+ 34. Kh3 Qa3+ 35. Bf3 $18 {PS}) (32. Nxe3 Qxe3 $2 {! PS} (32... dxe3 33. Rxc8+ Kxc8 34. Qxf6 $16) 33. Qxd7 Qc1+ $2 (33... Rxg8 34. Qxd6+ Ka7 35. Qc5+ (35. Qc7+ Ka8 36. Kh2 Qe1 37. Qc6+ $11 {PS}) 35... Kb8 (35... Kb7 $11 {PS}) 36. Qb6+ $18) (33... Qe1+ 34. Kh2 Qxh4+ 35. Kg1 Qe1+ $11 {PS}) 34. Kh2 Qf4+ 35. Rg3 Rg8 36. Bg6 $18 {Soloviev}) 32... Kxc8 33. Nxe3 (33. Nb6+ Kc7 34. Nxd7 Qc1+ 35. Kh2 Nf1+ (35... Qe1 36. Nxf6+ (36. Ne5+ Kb6 37. Nf3 Nf1+ 38. Kg1 Qc1 39. Kf2 Ne3 40. Qxf6) 36... Kb6 37. Kh3 Qh1+ 38. Kg3 Qe1+ 39. Kf4 Nxg2+ 40. Kg5 Qxh4+ 41. Kh6 Ne3 42. Nd5+ $18) 36. Kh3 $18 {PS}) 33... Qxe3 34. Bf3 Qc1+ 35. Kh2 Qf4+ 36. Kg1 Qc1+ 37. Kh2 Qf4+ 38. Kg1 Qc1+ (38... Qxh4 $1 $11) 39. Kh2 Qf4+ (39... Qf4+ 40. Kh3 $16) 1/2-1/2

