.. Rg3+ 32. Rf3 Rxf3+ 33. Kxf3 Rc3 34. Ke3 f5 35. Rf2 fxe4 36. Kxe4 Rc4+ 37. Ke5 {ChessCalisthenics: '?'} (37. Kf3 $142 $19 {ChessCalisthenics}) 37... Ke7 38. h5 Ra4 39. Nc5 Rh4 40. Nxe6 Rxh5+ 41. Kd4 Kxe6 42. Rf3 Rh4+ 43. Kc3 {ChessCalisthenics: '?'} (43. Kc5 $142 $17 {ChessCalisthenics}) 43... f5 44. Kb3 f4 45. Kc4 Ke5 46. Rxa3 (46. Rc3 $19 {ChessCalisthenics}) 46... f3+ 47. Kd3 Rf4 48. Ra5+ {ChessCalisthenics} Kd6 $19 0-1

