{ChessCalisthenics: 'B76: Sicilian Dragon: Yugoslav Attack, 9 g4 and 9 0-0-0'} 1. e4 {1)Müller,Karsten:Bobby Fischer.2009. Russell Enterprise. p.35-38. 25 players. Swiss. 10R. Results: 1.Kalme 9/10 2.Remlinger 7,5/10 3.Cross 7,0/10. 20.Fischer,Robert James 5,0/10.} c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 d6 6. Be2 g6 7. Be3 Bg7 8. f3 O-O 9. Qd2 a6 10. O-O-O Qa5 11. Kb1 Rd8 12. g4 Nxd4 13. Bxd4 (13. Qxd4 $143 Nd7 14. Qc4 Bxc3 15. Qxc3 Qxc3 16. bxc3 Rf8 $11) 13... Be6 14. Qe3 Nd7 15. f4 Bxd4 16. Qxd4 Nf6 17. f5 Bd7 18. h4 Bb5 19. Bf3 Rac8 20. Nxb5 (20. g5 Rxc3 21. bxc3 Nd7 $18) 20... axb5 21. h5 Rc4 22. Qe3 Ra8 23. a3 Qa4 24. c3 (24. Rh2 b4 25. hxg6 bxa3 $14) 24... Nxe4 25. Bxe4 Rxe4 26. Qh6 {ChessCalisthenics: '??'} (26. Qd2 $142 $5 Rxg4 27. hxg6 Qe4+ 28. Ka1 Qxf5 29. gxh7+ Kh8 30. Rdf1 $11) 26... Re2 27. Rd2 {ChessCalisthenics: '??'} (27. Qc1 $142 Qe4+ 28. Ka1 $17) 27... Rxd2 28. Qxd2 Qe4+ 29. Ka2 Qxh1 30. hxg6 hxg6 $19 0-1

[Event "Candidates Tournament"]
[Site "Bled/Zagreb/Belgrade"]
[Date "1959.09.28"]
[Round "13"]
[White "Fischer, Robert James"]
[Black "Tal, Mihail"]
[Result "0-1"]
[ECO "B87"]
[Annotator "Demuth,Adrien"]
[PlyCount "66"]
[EventDate "1959.09.07"]
[EventType "tourn"]
[EventRounds "28"]
[EventCountry "CRO"]
