0... c3 $1 41. Rf2 $2 (41. Kxc3 Ra3+ 42. Kd4 Rxf3 43. c4 $18 {Keres,P}) 41... Ra3 42. Kc4 h5 43. Kb4 Ra8 44. f4 (44. Kxc3 h4 $132) 44... Ke4 $1 45. fxg5 Ke3 46. Rg2 (46. Rf7 Kd2) 46... Kd4 (46... Rc8 47. h4 Kf3 48. Rg1 Kf2 49. Rd1 Kxg3 50. Rd4 $18 { c4}) 47. Re2 Rb8+ 48. Ka4 Rg8 49. h4 Rf8 50. Re7 (50. g4 hxg4 51. g6) 50... Rf3 51. Rd7+ Kc4 52. Rc7+ Kd4 53. Rd7+ Kc4 54. Rc7+ Kd4 55. Kb3 Rxg3 56. Rd7+ Ke4 57. Rh7 Kd4 58. Rxh5 Rg1 59. Rh8 Rb1+ 60. Ka4 Ra1+ (60... Rb2 61. g6 $18) 61. Kb5 Rb1+ 62. Kc6 Rg1 63. Rd8+ Kc4 64. Re8 { e4+ # Fischer,R: '!'} Kb4 (64... Kd4 {Fischer,R} 65. Re2 Rg4 66. Kd6 Rxh4 67. Rg2 $18 {Matanovic}) 65. Kd5 Rd1+ (65... Ka3 66. Rb8 $18) 66. Ke6 Re1+ 67. Kf7 Rf1+ 68. Kg6 Rf2 69. h5 Rxc2 70. h6 Rh2 71. h7 c2 72. Rc8 Kb3 73. Kg7 1-0

