1. e4 {Petronijevic,Zoran} c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. c4 Nf6 5. Nc3 g6 6. Qb3 Bg7 7. cxd5 O-O 8. Be2 (8. g3 $1 Na6 9. Bg2 Qb6 10. Qxb6 axb6 11. Nge2 Nb4 12. O-O Rd8 13. d6 $1 $14) 8... Na6 (8... Nbd7 {[%cal Yd7b6] Petronijevic,Zoran}) 9. Bg5 (9. Bf3 Qb6 10. Qd1 $5 Rd8 11. Nge2 Nb4 12. Nf4 Qxd4 $1 13. Qe2 g5 $15) 9... Qb6 (9... Qa5 {Petronijevic,Zoran}) 10. Qxb6 (10. Nf3 {Petronijevic,Zoran} Qxb3 11. axb3 Nb4 12. Bxf6 Bxf6 13. O-O Bg4 $11 {½-½ Bryson,D-Arkell,K/England 2001/EXT 2002 (77)}) 10... axb6 11. a3 (11. d6 {Petronijevic,Zoran} exd6 12. Nf3 Nb4 13. O-O Nbd5 14. Nb5 Rd8 15. Bc4 h6 16. Bh4 $13 {0-1 Dubinsky,R-Yevseev,D/Moscow 1996/CBM 56 ext (46)}) 11... Rd8 12. Bxf6 (12. Nf3 {Petronijevic,Zoran}) 12... Bxf6 13. Rd1 Bf5 14. Bc4 (14. Nf3 {Petronijevic,Zoran} Nc7 $11) 14... Rac8 15. Bb3 b5 $1 16. Nf3 (16. Nxb5 {Petronijevic,Zoran} Bc2 17. Bxc2 Rxc2 $44 {[%cal Rc2b2,Rd8d5]}) 16... b4 17. axb4 Nxb4 {Petronijevic,Zoran: '='} 18. Ke2 Bc2 19. Bxc2 Nxc2 20. Kd3 Nb4+ 21. Ke4 Rd6 22. Ne5 Bg7 (22... Rcd8 {Petronijevic,Zoran}) 23. g4 f5+ (23... Rcd8 {Petronijevic,Zoran} 24. Nc4 R6d7 25. Ne3 e6 $11) 24. gxf5 gxf5+ 25. Kf4 (25. Kxf5 {Petronijevic,Zoran} Nxd5 (25... Rf8+ 26. Ke4 Rxf2) 26. Nxd5 e6+ 27. Ke4 exd5+ 28. Kd3 Rb6 $11) 25... Rf8 (25... Nxd5+ {Petronijevic,Zoran} 26. Nxd5 Rxd5 27. Kxf5 Rcd8 28. Rhe1 Rxd4 29. Rxd4 Rxd4) 26. Rhg1 Nxd5+ 27. Nxd5 Rxd5 $15 28. Nf3 Kh8 29. Rge1 Bf6 30. Ne5 (30. Re6 {Petronijevic,Zoran} Rc8) 30... e6 {Petronijevic,Zoran: '='} 31. h4 Rc8 (31... Bxh4 $2 {Petronijevic,Zoran} 32. Rh1 $16) 32. Nf7+ Kg7 33. Ng5 Bxg5+ 34. Kxg5 Rc6 35. Re5 Rcd6 36. Rxd5 Rxd5 37. f4 Rb5 38. Rd2 Rb3 39. d5 h6+ 40. Kh5 exd5 41. Rxd5 Rxb2 42. Rd7+ Kf6 43. Rd6+ Kf7 44. Rxh6 Rg2 45. Rb6 Rg4 46. Rxb7+ Kf6 47. Rb4 {Petronijevic,Zoran} Ke6 $11 {½-½ (47) Fischer,R-Yanofsky,D Netanya 6/232 1968 CI1-130 [Ciocaltea,Victor]} 1/2-1/2

