{[%evp 0,19,19,38,40,41,66,66,57,33,33,27,50,61,74,51,40,57,70,52,40,15]} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bg5 ({Fischer more often played} 6. Bc4 {The Sozin attack.}) 6... e6 7. Qf3 ({At the time this game was played, the game move was more popular than} 7. f4) 7... Be7 (7... Nbd7 {is the alternative.}) 8. O-O-O Qc7 9. Qg3 ({Interesting is} 9. g4) 9... Nbd7 10. Nb3 $6 {Too circumspect move. Better was any developing move.} b5 11. a3 Bb7 12. f3 (12. Bd3 {was interesting.}) 12... O-O-O $6 (12... O-O {was preferable.}) 13. Bxb5 $6 ({This sharp move leads to an unclear play. Preferable was} 13. Kb1 $16) 13... Ne5 $2 ({This move loses. After a better} 13... axb5 14. Nxb5 Qb6 15. Nxd6+ Bxd6 16. Rxd6 Nh5 {the position is unclear.}) 14. Be2 $18 h5 15. h4 Nc4 (15... d5 $5 {was more cautious.}) 16. Rd4 Na5 17. Nxa5 Qxa5 18. Ra4 Qb6 19. Rb4 Qa5 20. Be3 (20. Na4 $5) 20... Nd7 21. Ra4 (21. Na4 {was stronger.}) 21... Qe5 22. Bf4 Qf6 23. Bxd6 Nb6 24. Bxe7 Qxe7 25. Rb4 Qc5 26. Kb1 Rd2 27. Bd3 Qc7 28. Qg5 Rxd3 29. cxd3 f6 30. Qe3 Nd7 31. Rc4 Bc6 32. Rc1 Kd8 33. Ne2 Ne5 34. Nd4 Nxc4 35. Rxc4 1-0

