{Ivkov,Borislav: 'various: 'This game appeared in Informator 2, game 282. Althiough drawn, any game between these two great champions is relevant of course.''} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O Be7 6. Re1 b5 7. Bb3 O-O 8. c3 d5 9. exd5 Nxd5 10. Nxe5 Nxe5 11. Rxe5 c6 12. g3 {Ivkov,Borislav: '!?' '!?' Ivkov,Borislav: 'various: 'Fischer rewrites theory. His plan is to prevent . ..Qh4-h3 but it doesn't really as Black could have played ...Qd7-h3 instead. Black has other plans available, e.g. 12...Bf6 as in Braga-Geller.''} Nf6 {Ivkov,Borislav: '!?' '!?'} (12... Bd6 13. Re1 Qd7) (12... Re8 $1 {Ivkov,Borislav: 'various: '!?' various: 'Ivkov''}) (12... Bf6 13. Re1 c5 (13... Ra7 14. d4 Re7 15. Rxe7 Qxe7 16. Bxd5 cxd5 17. Be3 Re8 18. Nd2 Bh3 19. Qf3 Qe6 20. Re1 Bg4 $10 {Fischer-O'Kelly/Havana/1965/}) 14. d4 (14. d3 Bb7 15. Nd2 b4 16. Ne4 bxc3 17. Rb1 Bd4 18. Bg5 {Posniak-Rapoport/corr/1974/}) 14... cxd4 (14... Bb7 15. dxc5 Re8 16. Nd2 Nxc3 $1 17. bxc3 Bxc3 18. c6 Bxc6 19. Rxe8+ Qxe8 20. Rb1 Rd8 21. Qc2 Bxd2 22. Bxd2 Be4 $15 {Braga-Geller}) 15. cxd4 Bb7 16. Nc3 Nxc3 17. bxc3 Qd7 (17... b4 $5 {Matanovic-Ostojic/Jugoslavia/1969/}) 18. Be3 Rae8 $10 {Matanovic-Geller/Sousse/1967/}) 13. d4 Bd6 {inconsistent} (13... c5 {Ivkov,Borislav: '!?' Ivkov,Borislav: 'Spassky'} 14. Bg5 $13) 14. Re1 Bg4 {Ivkov,Borislav: 'various: 'Diagram #''} (14... Qd7 15. Bg5) (14... Qc7 15. Bg5 Nd5 16. Be3 f5 17. f4 Kh8 $10 {Junge-Brookings/Teeside/1973/}) 15. Qd3 {Ivkov,Borislav: '?' '?' Ivkov,Borislav: 'various: '!?''} (15. f3 Bf5 (15... Bh5 16. Nd2 (16. Be3 Qd7 (16... Ne4 17. Nd2 Nxd2 18. Bxd2 Qf6 19. Kg2 Rae8 20. Rxe8 Rxe8 21. Qf1 c5 22. Qf2 {Vukcevic-Morozov/corr/1975/})) 16... c5 $1 17. Ne4 Nxe4 18. Rxe4 c4 19. Bc2 f5 20. Re1 f4 21. g4 Bxg4 $1 22. fxg4 f3 $17 {threat 23...Qh4 V.Mikenas}) (15... Bh3 {Yudovich-Zapletal}) 16. Bg5 (16. Be3 $16 {Ivkov,Borislav: 'various: 'Informator 2''}) 16... c5 $44) 15... c5 {Ivkov,Borislav: '!' '!'} 16. dxc5 {Ivkov,Borislav: 'various: 'Fischer misses his chance to establish some advantage.''} (16. Bc2 {Ivkov,Borislav: '!' Ivkov,Borislav: 'Fischer'} Re8 (16... c4 17. Qf1 Qd7 18. f3 Bh3 19. Qf2 $14 {Nunn}) 17. Be3 cxd4 18. cxd4 Rc8 $36) 16... Bxc5 17. Qxd8 Raxd8 {Ivkov,Borislav: '=' '=' Ivkov,Borislav: 'various: '''} 18. Bf4 (18. Bg5 Rfe8 19. Nd2 Rxe1+ 20. Rxe1 h6 21. Bxf6 Rxd2 $11 {Nunn Nunn Nunn Blatny,P: '='}) 18... h6 19. Na3 g5 20. Be3 (20. Be5 Rd2 {Ivkov,Borislav: 'Nunn'} 21. Bxf6 $2 Bxf2+ $19 {Spassky}) 20... Bxe3 21. Rxe3 Rd2 {Ivkov,Borislav: 'various: '=''} 22. Nc2 (22. c4 Rb8 (22... Be2 $2 23. Re1 Re8 24. Rxe8+ Nxe8 25. cxb5 axb5 26. Nb1 Rxb2 27. Nc3 $18) 23. cxb5 axb5 24. Re7 Bh5 $14) 22... Re8 23. Rxe8+ Nxe8 24. Ne3 Bf3 25. Bc2 Nd6 26. b3 Kf8 (26... Ne4 27. Bxe4 Bxe4 28. a4) 27. a4 Ne4 28. Bxe4 (28. axb5 Nxf2 29. Bf5 g4 $1 {Spassky}) 28... Bxe4 29. axb5 axb5 30. b4 Rb2 31. g4 Kg7 32. Kf1 Kf6 33. Ra5 Rb1+ 34. Ke2 Rb2+ 35. Kf1 1/2-1/2

