{[%evp 0,14,24,25,27,-4,-10,7,-11,-10,2,10,30,0,0,-4,6]} 1. Nf3 Nf6 2. g3 Nc6 ({More common are either} 2... d5) ({or} 2... g6) 3. d4 d5 4. Bg2 e6 (4... Bf5 {is interesting.}) 5. O-O Be7 6. c4 dxc4 ({Preferable is} 6... O-O $14) 7. Qa4 $1 O-O 8. Qxc4 Bd7 $6 ({Bishop on d7 is not well placed. Better was} 8... Na5 9. Qc2 b6 $14) 9. Rd1 (9. a3 $5) 9... a6 (9... Rc8 $5 $16) 10. Ne5 Na5 $6 ({Better was} 10... Nxe5 {although after} 11. dxe5 Nd5 12. Nc3 $16 {White is clearly better.}) 11. Qc3 ({At the time this game was played, Bobby wasn't able to find a more subtle} 11. Qc2) 11... c6 $4 ({This move loses on the spot. After} 11... Nc6 {White is clearly better although far away from win.}) 12. b4 $18 Nd5 13. Bxd5 cxd5 14. Nxd7 Rc8 15. Qd3 Qxd7 16. bxa5 Bb4 17. Bd2 Bd6 18. Nc3 Bb4 $6 19. Nxd5 Qxd5 20. Bxb4 Rfe8 21. e4 Qg5 22. d5 exd5 23. exd5 Rcd8 24. d6 Rd7 25. Re1 Rxe1+ 26. Rxe1 f5 27. Qd5+ Kf8 28. Re8+ $1 1-0

