{[%evp 0,11,37,24,29,66,60,37,37,35,81,67,47,8]} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 g6 5. Nc3 ({After} 5. c4 {we are reaching The Maroczy Bind.}) 5... Bg7 6. Be3 Nf6 7. f3 ({More precise is} 7. Bc4) 7... O-O 8. Qd2 ({In the case of} 8. Bc4 {Black has} Qb6 {which gives him a comfortable play.}) 8... d5 $11 9. Nxc6 $6 ({Dubious move. Preferable is} 9. O-O-O $13) 9... bxc6 10. O-O-O Bb7 $6 ({Stronger was a subtle} 10... Qc7 $17) 11. e5 Nd7 12. Bh6 $2 ({The game move is a mistake. After a better} 12. f4 $13 {the position is unclear.}) 12... Bxh6 $1 13. Qxh6 Nxe5 $17 14. h4 f6 $1 {Black refutes White's kingside attack.} 15. h5 $2 (15. Qe3 $17 {was better.}) 15... Nf7 $2 ({Black misses a very strong} 15... g5 16. Bd3 Rf7 $19 {[%csl Rh6] after which the Queen is in a prison.}) 16. Qf4 Qd6 17. Qg4 Kg7 (17... g5 $17 {was stronger.}) 18. hxg6 hxg6 19. Bd3 Ne5 20. Qd4 Rh8 $2 (20... c5 $17 {was better.}) 21. Ne2 $2 ({After a better} 21. Rxh8 Nxd3+ 22. Rxd3 Kxh8 23. Rd1 $15 {Black only has a slight edge.}) 21... c5 22. Qf2 c4 (22... d4 {was interesting.}) 23. f4 (23. Rxh8 $5) 23... Ng4 $19 24. Qg3 f5 25. Nd4 cxd3 26. cxd3 Qc5+ 27. Nc2 Rac8 0-1

