{ChessCalisthenics: 'C92: Closed Ruy Lopez: 9...Be6, Karpov and Flohr-Zaitsev Variations' 200 Open Games by David Bronstein 19. The Ancient Spanish Game (Ruy Lopez's Opening) CARDOSO THE CONQUEROR   Estratégia - Carlos Alejandro Martinez - Aula 05 Variante 04 Luta do  bom contra o  mau Posições diversas # 12} 1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O Be7 6. Re1 b5 7. Bb3 d6 8. c3 O-O 9. h3 Nd7 10. d4 (10. a4 {Fischer-Kalme/USA-ch/1960} Bb7 11. d4 Na5 $11 {[%cal Yc7c5]}) 10... Nb6 (10... Bf6 11. a4 Na5 (11... Bb7 12. axb5 axb5 13. Rxa8 Qxa8 14. d5 Na5 15. Bc2 $14) 12. Bc2 Nb6 13. b4 (13. axb5 axb5 14. d5 $14) 13... Nac4 (13... Nc6 $2 14. axb5 axb5 15. Rxa8 Nxa8 16. d5 Na7 17. Be3 $16 {Geller-Matanovic/Skopje/1968}) 14. a5 Nd7 15. Bb3 $1 $14 {Nun droht immer c4 nebst a3. Fischer,R-Matanovic,A Vinkovci 1968}) 11. Be3 (11. Nbd2 exd4 12. cxd4 d5 13. Bc2 $14 {Fischer-Reshevsky/Santa Monica/1966}) 11... Rb8 12. Nbd2 (12. dxe5 Nxe5 13. Nxe5 dxe5 14. Qh5 Qd6 15. Nd2 Bf6 16. Nf3 Nc4 17. Rad1 Qe7 18. Bg5 g6 19. Bxf6 Qxf6 20. Qh6 Qe7 21. Rd3 f6 22. Nh4 g5 23. Nf5 Bxf5 24. exf5 Kh8 25. Red1 Rfd8 26. Rxd8+ Rxd8 {Tal, M (2625)-Darga,K (2540)/Munich 1958/MCD/1-0 (35)}) 12... Bf6 13. d5 (13. Nf1 Na5 14. Bc2 Nac4 15. Bc1 c5 16. b3 Na5 17. Be3 (17. Ne3 exd4 18. cxd4 Nc6 $15 {Mnatsakanian-Zilber,SU 1958}) 17... Qc7 18. Ng3 g6 19. Qd2 Bg7 20. Rad1 Nd7 21. Bb1 (21. d5 $14) 21... Re8 22. Bh6 Nf6 23. Qg5 Bxh6 24. Qxh6 Qe7 25. Rd2 Nd7 26. dxc5 dxc5 27. Nf1 Qf8 {Zelic,Z (2395)-Ivkov,B (2490)/Zlatibor 1989/EXT 2000/1/ 2-1/2 (46)}) (13. Bc2 Re8 (13... d5 $2 14. dxe5 Nxe5 15. Nxe5 Bxe5 16. Bxb6 $16 { Nf3}) 14. Rc1 Bd7 (14... Bb7 $1 15. d5 Ne7 16. b3 c5 17. dxc6 (17. c4 $5) 17... Bxc6 18. c4 Ng6 $13) 15. b3 Ne7 16. Bd3 Ng6 17. Qc2 Nh4 18. Nxh4 Bxh4 19. dxe5 dxe5 20. c4 c6 21. Nf3 Bf6 22. a4 bxa4 23. bxa4 c5 24. Bxc5 Nxa4 25. Bd6 Rb2 26. Qd1 Qa5 27. Bc2 Rd8 {Ljubojevic,L (2600)-Ivkov,B (2480)/ Bugojno 1982/MCD/1-0 (41)}) (13. Qe2 Na5 14. Bc2 Nbc4 15. Nxc4 Nxc4 16. Bc1 Re8 17. a4 c5 18.