{Bobby Fischer: 'GAME N. 9 Betwixt the cup and the lip.  Here, against a minor European master. Fischer appears to be busted after seventeen moves, and admits he was ready to resign on move 36. Nevertheless, he extracts a miraculous draw from a hopeless ending. two Pawns down. Time and again Walther fumbles. aI/owing Fischer to prolong the struggle until he gets his break on move 54.  What makes this game memorable is the demonstration it affords of the way in which a Grandmaster redeems himself after having started like a duffer: and how a weaker opponent. after masterfully building a winning position. often lacks the technique required to administer the coup de grace. As Capablanca remarked, "The good player is always lucky." ' Nach dem 17.Zug steht Fischer aufgrund einer mangelhaft gespielten Eröffnung kurz vor dem Zusammenbruch. Hätte Walther den richtigen 36. Zug gewählt, so wäre die Partie dort zu seinen Gunsten enschieden worden. Er tändelt aber herum und Fischer gelingt eine phantastische Rettung.  Tal verliert in dieser Runde, Gligoric und Kerse gewinnen. PS} 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bg5 e6 7. f4 Be7 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Sharper is'} 7... Qb6 8. Qd2 Qxb2 9. Rb1 Qa3 $13 {Fischer=:F Bobby Fischer: 'which I tried with success later in my career.'}) 8. Qf3 Nbd7 ({Bobby Fischer: 'More exact is'} 8... Qc7 $142 {F Bobby Fischer: 'to prevent Bc4'}) 9. O-O-O ({Bobby Fischer: 'Sharper is'} 9. Bc4 {Bobby Fischer: '!'} O-O (9... Qc7 $2 10. Bxe6 $1 fxe6 11. Nxe6 Qb6 12. Nxg7+ Kf7 13. Nf5 $18 { Bobby Fischer: 'with a crushing attack)'}) 10. O-O-O $13 {F}) 9... Qc7 10. Bd3 ({Bobby Fischer: 'For'} 10. Be2 {Keres,P-Fischer,R/Bled ct/1959 Bobby Fischer: 'see game 14: Keres,P-Fischer,R; Bled ct, 1959.' Keres,P-Fischer,R Bled ct 1959}) ({Bobby Fischer: 'For'} 10. g4 {Gligoric,S-Fischer,R/Beograd ct/1959 /Smyslov,V-Fischer,R/Beograd ct/1959 Bobby Fischer: 'see games 12 and 15: Gligoric,S-Fischer,R; Beograd ct, 1959, and Smyslov,V-Fischer,R; Beograd ct, 1959.' Gligoric,S-Fischer,R Beograd ct 1959 Smyslov,V-Fischer,R Beograd ct 1959}) 10... b5 11. Bxf6 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Better is'} 11. a3 $142 {F Bobby Fischer: '>='}) 11... Nxf6 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Only not'} 11... Bxf6 $2 12. Bxb5 $1 axb5 13. Ndxb5 $18 {F/Euwe=:E Bobby Fischer: 'wins.'}) (11... gxf6 12. Qh5 {E Euwe}) 12. Rhe1 (12. a3 $142 {F Bobby Fischer: 'is necessary.'}) ({Bobby Fischer: 'Black comes out all right after'} 12. e5 Bb7 13. Qg3 dxe5 14. fxe5 Nd7 15. Rhe1 O-O-O $1 $17 {Paoli,E-Tolusch,A/Balatonfuered/1958 Bobby Fischer: '!' Bobby Fischer: '(Paoli,E-Tolusch,A; Balatonfuered, 1958.)' Paoli,E-Tolusch,A Balatonfuered 1958}) 12... Bb7 ({Bobby Fischer: 'As I learned (see game 15), Black should avail himself of'} 12... b4 $142 $1 { b7, d6-d5 F Bobby Fischer: '!' Bobby Fischer: '(followed by ...Bb7, and ...d5) the instant he has the opportunity.'  b7, d6-d5 Fischer}) 13. Kb1 ({Bobby Fischer: 'At the risk of repeating myself,'} 13. a3 $142 {F Bobby Fischer: 'is mandatory.'}) 13... Rc8 $2 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Right is'} 13... b4 {} 14. Nce2 (14. Na4 Nd7 $10 { 15.f5 e5 E '='}) 14... g6 $1 15. g4 e5 16. Nb3 d5 17. Nd2 O-O $36 {F Bobby Fischer: 'with initiative.'}) 14. g4 (14. a3 $142 {F Bobby Fischer: 'is still correct. We both suffered from the idee fixe that ...b4 was unplayable.'}) 14... Nd7 (14... b4 $142 15. Na4 d5 {E Euwe} (15... Nd7)) 15. g5 Nb6 $2 (15... b4 $1 16. Nce2 (16. Nd5 $1 exd5 17. exd5 g6 {E Euwe}) 16... Nc5 $13 {F Bobby Fischer: 'still makes a fight of it.'}) 16. f5 $1 e5 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Now on'} 16... b4 $2 17. fxe6 $1 $18 {F Bobby Fischer: '!' Bobby Fischer: 'splatters Black.'}) ({Bobby Fischer: 'Not'} 16... Bxg5 $2 17. Bxb5+ $1 Ke7 18. fxe6 fxe6 19. Nxe6 $1 $18 {F Bobby Fischer: 'etc.'}) (16... exf5 17. Nd5 Nxd5 18. exd5 O-O 19. Nxf5 Bxg5 20. Rg1 $18 {E Euwe}) 17. f6 $1 gxf6 ({Bobby Fischer: 'I'd overlooked that on'} 17... exd4 18. Nd5 $1 $18 {F/E Bobby Fischer: '!' Bobby Fischer: 'is deadly.'}) 18. gxf6 Bf8 19. Nd5 $1 $18 {F} Nxd5 (19... Qc5 $2 20. Nb3 Qc6 21. Na5 $18 {E Euwe}) (19... Qd8 20. Ne6 $1 fxe6 21. Qh5+ Kd7 22. Qf7+ Kc6 23. Nb4+ Kc5 24. Qxb7 Kxb4 25. a3+ Kc5 26. b4+ Kd4 27. Bf1+ Kc3 28. Re3# {E Euwe}) (19... Bxd5 20. exd5 {× c6 E × c6 Euwe}) 20. exd5 Kd8 21. Nc6+ $1 $40 Bxc6 22. dxc6 Qxc6 23. Be4 Qb6 (23... Qc7 24. Bf5 { 25.e5 E  25.e5 Euwe}) 24. Qh5 { 25.e5, 25.f7 E} (24. Bf5 Rc5 $2 25. Qa8+ $18 {E Euwe}) 24... Kc7 25. Bf5 $1 {F} (25. Qxf7+ $142 Kb8 26. Qd5 $18 {E Euwe}) 25... Rd8 26. Qxf7+ Kb8 27. Qe6 { 28.e5 E} Qc7 28. Re3 $1 Bh6 (28... h5 $142 {E Euwe}) 29. Rc3 Qb7 (29... Rhe8 30. Qd5 Qb7 31. Rc6 $40 {E Euwe}) 30. f7 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Not'} 30. Rxd6 $4 Qh1+ {F/E}) 30... Bg7 (30... Bf8 $142 {E Euwe}) 31. Rcd3 (31. Rg3 Bf8 32. Rg8 Be7 33. Rxh8 Rxh8 34. Be4 Qa7 35. a4 $1 { 36.d6} Rd8 36. axb5 axb5 37. Qd5 $18 {E Euwe}) 31... Bf8 32. Qxe5 $1 $18 dxe5 33. Rxd8+ Ka7 34. R1d7 h5 35. Rxb7+ Kxb7 36. c3 Kc7 37. Ra8 $6 {F} ({Bobby Fischer: 'On'} 37. Re8 $1 $18 {F Bobby Fischer: '!' Bobby Fischer: 'Black resigns.' Nach diesm Zug hätte ich aufgegeben. Fischer} h4 38. h3 Kd6 39. Kc2 Rh5 40. Bg4 Rh8 41. Kd3 Kd5 42. Bf3+ Kd6 43. Ke4 $18 {E Euwe}) 37... Kd6 38. Rxa6+ ({Bobby Fischer: 'I was still prepared to resign after'} 38. Re8 $1 $18 {F/E Bobby Fischer: '!' Bobby Fischer: 'Black has absolutely no moves. White simply strolls his King to e4, creating zugzwang.' Fischer/Euwe}) 38... Ke7 39. Re6+ ({Bobby Fischer: 'Even simpler is'} 39. Ra7+ {''} Kf6 40. Bd3 $18 {F Fischer}) 39... Kxf7 40. Rxe5 b4 {adjourned} 41. cxb4 Bxb4 42. h3 Kf6 43. Rb5 Bd6 44. Be4 ({Bobby Fischer: 'On'} 44. a4 Rb8 $1 {Bobby Fischer: 'forces the exchange of Rooks (If'} 45. Rd5 {Bobby Fischer: '?'} Be5 $132 {F}) (44. Bd3 $142 {E Euwe}) 44... Re8 45. Rf5+ Kg7 46. Bf3 Re1+ 47. Kc2 Rf1 $1 { 48... f2 49.b1 (49.b3 g6) f1= F} 48. Rd5 (48. Z0 {The threat was} Rf2+ 49. Kb1 ({if} 49. Kb3 $2 Kg6 {wins a piece. '!'}) 49... Rf1+ {with a draw. '='}) 48... Rf2+ 49. Rd2 (49. Kb1 Ba3 $1 50. bxa3 Rxf3 51. Rxh5 Rxa3 $18 {F Bobby Fischer: 'is also hopeless for Black.'}) 49... Rxd2+ ({Bobby Fischer: 'Or'} 49... Rxf3 50. Rxd6 Rxh3 51. a4 $18 {F Bobby Fischer: 'etc.'}) 50. Kxd2 h4 51. Kd3 Kf6 52. Kc4 Ke7 53. Kb5 Kd7 54. a4 $2 $10 ({Bobby Fischer: 'The Swiss endgame composer, Fontana, pointed out the proper method:'} 54. b4 $1 Kc7 55. Ka5 {Bobby Fischer: '!' '!'} Kb8 56. b5 Ba3 (56... Ka7 57. b6+) 57. b6 (57. Ka4 $2 Bc5 58. Ka5 Ka7 $10 {'='}) 57... Kc8 58. Ka6 Kb8 59. Bg2 $1 {Bobby Fischer: 'and Black is in zugzwang. If 59..'} Kc8 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Or'} 59... Bc5 60. a4) 60. Ka7 Bc5 (60... Bd6 61. a4 $18 {Fontana}) 61. a4 $18 {Fontana Bobby Fischer: 'etc.'}) 54... Kc7 55. b4 Kb8 56. a5 Ka7 57. Kc4 Bg3 58. Kb3 (58. b5 {Accoring to Fischer is this the played move 58.b5.} Bf2 59. Be2 (59. b6+ {is met by} Bxb6 $1 {'=!' Fischer} 60. axb6+ Kxb6 61. Kd5 Kc7 62. Ke6 Kd8 63. Bh5 Kc7 64. Bf7 Kd8 65. Kf6 Kd7 $11 {Matanovic}) 59... Be3 {½-½ (63) Walther,E-Fischer,R Zurich 1959 My 60 Memorable Games [Bobby Fischer]} 60. Kd5 Bd2 $11 {Matanovic}) 58... Be1 59. Ka4 Bd2 60. Bh5 Be1 61. b5 Bf2 $1 62. Be2 (62. b6+ Bxb6 63. axb6+ Kxb6 $10) 62... Be3 63. Kb3 Bd2 (63... Bf2 {also draws. '=' Fischer}) 64. b6+ (64. Ka4) 64... Kb7 65. Ka4 Kc6 $1 66. Bb5+ (66. Bf3+ Kc5 $1 $11 {Matanovic}) 66... Kc5 {Bobby Fischer: 'On'} 67. Be8 (67. b7 Bf4 68. a6 Kb6 $10 {Bobby Fischer: '=' '='}) 67... Be1 1/2-1/2

