{Bobby Fischer: 'GAME N. 15 A whopper. Here is Fischer's first win against Vassi/y Smyslov; and it is hard to recall when the former world champion. conducting White. has been so badly outplayed. On move 13 of a crucial opening variation, Smyslov makes what appears to be a "laps us manus." Rather than fight a prolonged uphill positional battle, he sacrifices a Pawn to try to regain the initiative. This proves to be a piece of bad judgment, since, basically, the loss of this Pawn alone brings about his demise. Defending with deadly precision, Fischer gradually consolidates - the shadow of his Pawn looming larger with each approach to the endgame. Smys/ov thrashes about. striving desperately for complications, avoiding exchanges like the plague. But he is unable to get off the hook. '} 1. e4 {Bobby Fischer} c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Bg5 ({for} 6. Be2 {(Bobby Fischer) see games 4 and 42. For 6 Bc4 see games 17, 55, 58 Pilnik, H-Fischer,R Mar del Plata 1959 Unzicker,W-Fischer,R Varna ol 1962 Fischer: 'Pilnik,H-Fischer,R Mar del Plata 1959 Unzicker,W-Fischer,R Varna ol 1962'}) (6. Bc4 {(Bobby Fischer) Fischer,R-Tal,M Beograd ct 1959 Fischer,R-Bednarski,J Habana ol 1966 Fischer, R-Geller,E Skopje 1967 Fischer: 'Fischer,R-Tal,M Beograd ct 1959 Fischer,R-Bednarski,J Habana ol 1966 Fischer,R-Geller,E Skopje 1967'}) 6... e6 7. f4 Be7 8. Qf3 Qc7 9. O-O-O Nbd7 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Weak is'} 9... h6 10. Bh4 Nbd7 11. Bd3 b5 12. e5 $1 Bb7 13. Nxe6 $1 fxe6 14. Bg6+ Kf8 15. exf6 Bxf3 {Bobby Fischer: 'better is'} (15... Nxf6 {    Bobby Fischer: '>='}) 16. fxe7+ Kg8 17. gxf3 Nf6 18. Bxf6 gxf6 19. e8=Q+ Rxe8 20. Bxe8 d5 {Gligoric,S-Bobotsov,M Hastings 1959 Gligoric,S-Bobotsov,M Hastings 1959 Gligoric,S-Bobotsov,M Hastings 1959 Gligoric,S-Bobotsov,M Hastings 1959 Bobby Fischer: 'Gligoric,S-Bobotsov,M Hastings 1959'} 21. f5 $1 $18 {Bobby Fischer: '(MCO) wins'}) 10. g4 (10. Bxf6 Bxf6 11. g4 Nc5 12. g5 Be7 13. Rg1 b5 14. a3 Rb8 15. f5 b4 16. axb4 Rxb4) 10... b5 11. 