' f7 ChessCalisthenics: 'Gagarin: '!' Gagarin: ' f7'''} Qe7 (32... Qe6 33. Rxf8+ Bxf8 34. Bxd4 Qxg4 35. Nxg4 exd4 36. Nxf6 $18 {PS: 'Gagarin'}) 33. Bxb5 $1 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: 'Gagarin: '!'''} Bxe4 (33... Nxb5 $2 34. Bc5 Qb7 (34... Nd6 35. Bxd6 Qxd6 36. Nf7+ $18) 35. Bxf8 $18 {PS: 'Gagarin'}) (33... f5 $142 $5 {Gagarin,Vasilij} 34. Rxf8+ Qxf8 35. exf5 Bxh6 36. Bxd4 exd4 37. fxg6 Qg7 $11) 34. Bc4 $1 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: 'Gagarin: '!'''} f5 $2 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: 'Gagarin: '?'''} (34... Bf5 35. Rxf8+ Qxf8 36. Nf7+ Qxf7 37. Bxf7 Bxg4 38. hxg4 $16 { PS: ' Gagarin'}) 35. Qg5 $1 $18 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: 'Gagarin: '+-!'''} (35. Rxf8+ {PS} Qxf8 36. Qg5 {[%cal Rh6f7]} Bxh6 37. Qxh6 Qxh6 38. Bxh6 $16 {b Kramer/Postma}) 35... Bf6 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: '??' '??'' PS: '?'} (35... Qxg5 36. Nf7+ $1 Kg8 37. Nxg5+ Kh8 38. Nf7+ Kg8 39. Nxe5+ $18 {PS: 'Gagarin'}) (35... Nf3+ $142 {Gagarin,Vasilij PS: '!'} 36. gxf3 Qxg5+ 37. Bxg5 Rxc8 38. Nf7+ Kg8 $15 39. Nxe5+ {PS} (39. Nd6+ {PS} Rxc4 40. Nxc4 Bxf3 $17) 39... Rxc4 (39... Kf8 40. Nd7+ Ke8 41. Nb6 Rb8 (41... Rc6 42. Bb5 Bxf3 43. Nc4 Kd7 44. Bf4 Ke6 45. Bxc6 Bxc6 $11 {PS}) 42. Bb5+ Kf7 (42... Kf8 43. Nd7+ $18) 43. Bc4+ Ke8 $11 {Kramer/Postma}) 40. Nxc4 Bxf3 $11 {PS}) 36. Nf7+ $1 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: 'Gagarin: '!'''} Kg8 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: '?' '?''} (36... Kg7 37. Qh6+ $18 {PS: 'Gagarin'}) (36... Qxf7 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: '!?' '!?''} 37. Bxf7 Bxg5 38. Rxf8+ Kg7 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: '+-' '+-''} 39. Rc8 $18 {PS: 'Gagarin'}) 37. Nxe5+ Ne6 (37... Kh8 38. Qh6 $18 {PS: 'Gagarin'}) 38. Nxg6 $1 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: 'Gagarin: '!'''} Bxg5 (38... hxg6 39. Bxe6+ $18 {PS: 'Gagarin'}) 39. Nxe7+ Bxe7 40. Bh6 $1 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: 'Gagarin: '!'''} Rxc8 41. Bxe6+ Kh8 42. Bxc8 Bf6 43. b4 Bd4 44. b5 Bd3 45. Bd7 Kg8 46. Be8 Bc4 47. g3 Bd3 48. Be3 Bxe3 (48... Kf8 {Gagarin,Vasilij} 49. Bc6 Bxe3 50. fxe3 $18) 49. fxe3 Kf8 50. b6 $1 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: 'Gagarin: '!'''} Be4 51. Bd7 Ke7 52. Bxf5 $1 {Gagarin,Vasilij: 'ChessCalisthenics: 'Gagarin: '!'''} Bxf5 {Gagarin,Vasilij} 1-0

