by Fischer: 'White regains the piece'}) 17. Bg4 Qf4 $1 (17... e5 18. Be6+ Kh8 19. Bxd5 $1) 18. Bxe6+ $1 (18. Nxe6 Qxf2+ 19. Kh1 Rf7 $1) 18... Bxe6 19. Nxe6 Qxf2+ 20. Kh1 Rf5 $1 21. Re2 $1 Qh4 22. Nd4 $1 Rh5 (22... Nxd4 $2 23. Bxe7) 23. Nf3 Qf6 24. Qe1 Re8 25. Re6 Qf7 26. Qe2 $1 Rh6 27. Re3 $36 { e1  e1  e1  e1 Bobby Fischer: 'followed by ... Re1 and Black's crushed.'} Rf6 28. Re1 $18 {(Gligoric 75)}) (15... N5g6 16. h4 $1 ({Bobby Fischer: 'on'} 16. Ng5 O-O $1 17. Bg4 Qf4 {Bobby Fischer: 'holds'}) 16... Nc6 17. Ng5 {Bobby Fischer: 'and it's difficult for Black's king to escape the criss-cross:'} O-O-O $2 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Or'} 17... h6 $2 18. Nxe6 $1 Bxe6 19. Bg4) ({Bobby Fischer: 'Finally. on'} 17... Nf4 18. Bg4 $36 {Bobby Fischer: 'continues the pressure.'}) 18. Nf7) (15... N7g6 16. Nxe5 Nxe5 17. f4) (15... Z0 {(Bobby Fischer) The threat is} 16. Nxe5 $140 Qxe5 17. Bh5+) 16. Nxe5 Nxe5 {Bobby Fischer: 'is just a transposition to the game.'} 17. f4 {Bobby Fischer: '?'} (17. Qd4 O-O-O {Fischer u.a.} 18. Bh5 $1 Ng6 19. a5 $1 b5 (19... Qf4 20. Bxg6 Qxd4 21. cxd4 hxg6 22. axb6 axb6 23. Be7 Rde8 24. Ra7 $1 {(Gligoric 75)}) 20. g3 Kb7 21. a6+ Ka8 22. f4 $16 {(eco 81)} Rde8 23. Re2 Rc8 24. Kh1 Rhe8 25. Rae1 Qb6 26. Qxg7 Qxa6 27. Qxd7 Qxa3 28. Rxe6 Red8 29. Qxb5 Rc5 30. Qb4 Qxb4 31. cxb4 Rcc8 32. f5 Nf8 33. Re7 Rb8 34. c3 {(Pritchett). 1-0 Pritchett,C-Markland,P/British-ch Blackpool 1971}) 17... Nc6 {Bobby Fischer: 'Diagram [#]'} ({Bobby Fischer: 'On'} 17... Nf7 18. Bh5 g6 19. f5 $1 O-O-O 20. fxe6 {Bobby Fischer: '!'} Bxe6 21. Rxe6 gxh5 22. Qxh5 $16 {Bobby Fischer: '+-' Bobby Fischer: 'White stands much better.'}) (17... Ng6 $2 18. f5 {Bobby Fischer: '!'}) 18. Bg4 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Better is the finesse'} 18. Bh5+ { Fischer u.a.: ''} g6 (18... Kd8 {Bobby Fischer: '?'} 19. f5) 19. Bg4 {'' (Fischer)} O-O-O 20. Bxe6 Bxe6 21. Rxe6 Rd7 22. Qf3 Nd8 23. Rf6 $1 Re8 24. Rd1) 18... O-O-O (18... Kf7 $2) 19. Bxe6 Bxe6 20. Rxe6 Rd7 21. f5 { f5-f6  f5-f6  f5-f6  f5-f6 Bobby Fischer: 'To continue with f6, which gets a grip on the f-file.'} ({Bobby Fischer: 'On'} 21. Qf3 Nd8 22. Re5 Qc6 $10 {Fischer u.a.: '='}) 21... Nd8 $1 {Bobby Fischer: 'Driving the rook from its command outpost on the sixth rank.'} 22. Re3 Qf4 {Bobby Fischer: 'Darga is defending with vigour!' '!'} 23. Rf3 Qe4 24. a5 $1 {Bobby Fischer: 'Commencing operations against the castled king while Black's queen is temporarily cut off from the queens ide.'} Nc6 $2 ({Bobby Fischer: 'Correct was'} 24... b5 $10 {Bobby Fischer: 'with an equal game.' Fischer u.a.: '='}) 25. axb6 axb6 26. Qb1 $1 Kc7 {Bobby Fischer: 'Diagram [#] The opening of the a-file is already decisive.'} ({Bobby Fischer: 'On'} 26... Kb7 27. Bc5 $18) ({Bobby Fischer: 'Or'} 26... Rb7 27. f6 gxf6 28. Rxf6 d4 29. Qb5 $18) 27. Bc1 $1 {'+-!'} Qe1+ {Bobby Fischer: 'There's no satisfactory defence to the threat of Bf4+.'} (27... Ne5 28. Bf4 Re8 29. Qb5 $18 {Bobby Fischer: 'penetrates decisively.'}) 28. Rf1 Qxc3 29. Bf4+ Kb7 30. Qb5 $1 1-0

