w Soltis: ''-+''}) ({Or if} 44. Ke1 {Bobby Fischer} Rf4 $19 {mops up. Andrew Soltis: ''-+''}) 44... Nf5 45. Rh3 Rg6+ 46. Kf3 {Bobby Fischer: 'Position after'} Nd4+ 47. Ke3 ({On Andrew Soltis: 'Fischer pointed out that'} 47. Ke4 {Bobby Fischer} Kd6 {White is in zugzwang. If Andrew Soltis: 'was zugzwang. For example '''} 48. Rh2 {to prevent Rg2 On} (48. a4 $2 {Andrew Soltis} bxa4 49. Ra3 Rg1 50. Rxa4 Re1#) 48... Rg3 {Andrew Soltis: ''-+' Fischer'}) 47... Rg2 $1 {ChessBase: 'Matanovic,Aleksandar: '!'' Andrew Soltis: 'The rest was kinderspiel :'} (47... Kd6 $19 {Andrew Soltis}) 48. Rh1 Kd6 49. Ne4+ Kxd5 50. Nc3+ Ke6 51. Rc1 (51. Rb1 {(Bobby Fischer) White has to prevent} Rc2 52. Ne4 {as then the Knight cannot move because of ...} Re2# {Mate}) 51... Rh2 52. a4 Rh3+ {Andrew Soltis: '!'} (52... bxa4 $6 {Andrew Soltis} 53. b5 (53. Nxa4 Re2#) 53... a3 54. b6 a2 55. b7 Rb2 $19) 53. Kf2 Nb3 {Andrew Soltis: ''!''} 54. Kg2 (54. Rc2 $4 {Andrew Soltis} Rh2+) 54... Nxc1 55. Kxh3 bxa4 56. Nxa4 Ne2 57. b5 c3 58. b6 c2 59. Nc5+ {Bobby Fischer: 'Position after'} Kd5 60. Nb3 ({White can choose his own end. If} 60. Nd3 {Bobby Fischer} Nf4+ 61. Nxf4+ exf4 62. b7 c1=Q 63. b8=Q Qh1# {Mate. Andrew Soltis: 'Fischer'}) (60. b7 {Bobby Fischer} c1=Q 61. b8=Q Qh1# {Mate. Andrew Soltis: 'Fischer'}) 60... Kc6 61. Kg2 Kxb6 {Bobby Fischer: 'White resigns'} 0-1

