d7 (17... a5 18. Qe1 $14) 18. Qa5 Ra7 19. g4 $1 (19. Qd2 Nc5 20. Nc3 Rb7 $132) 19... fxg4 20. fxg4 Qe8 (20... Qxg4 21. Qe1 Rb7 22. Be2 Qf5 23. Rg1 $16) (20... Qg6 21. Qd2 e4 22. h5 Qe8 23. Bh6 $16) 21. Qd2 $14) 17... f4 $6 {Weakening the e4-square.} (17... h6 18. g4 $2 (18. Be3 f4 19. Bf2 Bf5 20. Qxb4 (20. Bd3 Nd7 $132) 20... e4 $132) 18... fxg4 19. fxg4 Bxg4 20. Bxg4 Qxg4 21. Rdg1 Qxc4+ 22. Kd1 hxg5 (22... Qxa2 $1 23. Kc2 Qc4+ 24. Kd1 Qe4 $19) 23. Qxg5 {1-0 Lacoste,A-Santarelli,F/France 1979/Corr 2004 (37)} Qd4+ 24. Nd2 e4 25. h5 e3 26. Rg2 Rf2 27. Rxf2 exf2 28. h6 Nd7 29. hxg7 Qxg7 $19) (17... a5 $1 $132 {is correct, with counterplay.}) 18. g4 $1 {White attacks!} Qf7 (18... fxg3 $6 19. Rdg1 a5 20. Rxg3 Kh8 21. Rhg1 Nd7 22. Qe3 $16) 19. Bd3 $1 {White takes under his control the b1-h7 diagonal and the central e4-square.} h6 $6 (19... a5 20. Qc2 $1 {White can sacrifice his bishop.}) (19... Nd7 20. Qc2 Bh8 21. Bh6 Re8 22. Nd2 $16) 20. Qc2 $6 (20. Bxh6 $1 {is better:} Bxh6 21. g5 Kh8 (21... Bg7 22. h5 Nd7 23. Rdg1 Qe7 24. h6 $18) 22. gxh6 Nd7 23. Rhg1 Rg8 24. Rxg8+ Qxg8 25. Qxb4 a5 26. Qc3 Qf8 27. Rg1 Qxh6 28. Bc2 Nf6 29. c5 $18 {And White has a huge edge.}) 20... b3 (20... a5 21. Bxh6 Bxh6 22. g5 Kh8 (22... Bg7 23. h5 $16) 23. gxh6 Bf5 24. Rhg1 $16) 21. axb3 a5 22. Qe2 $2 {A mistake.} (22. Bg6 $1 Qd7 23. Bxh6 Bxh6 24. g5 Bg7 25. h5 Bh8 26. h6 Na6 27. Qh2 $18) 22... hxg5 23. hxg5 Rd8 (23... Re8 $5) 24. g6 (24. Rh7 $5 Nd7 25. Rdh1 $132) 24... Qe7 25. Nc3 $6 (25. Rh5 $5 $132) 25... Na6 (25... Nd7 $5) 26. Ne4 (26. Rh5 $5) 26... Nc5 27. Nxc5 dxc5 28. Rh5 a4 $1 $11 29. bxa4 $2 {A mistake.} (29. Rdh1 $1 axb3 30. Qh2 Ra1+ 31. Bb1 Qf6 32. Rh8+ $1 Bxh8 33. Qh7+ Kf8 34. Qxh8+ Qxh8 35. Rxh8+ Kg7 $1 36. Rxd8 Bxg4 37. fxg4 Rxb1+ $1 38. Kxb1 f3 39. Rd7+ Kxg6 40. Rd8 $1 Kg7 41. Rd7+ $11) 29... Rxa4 30. Kb1 Bd7 31. d6 cxd6 32. Be4 Be6 $19 {Now Black has an extra piece and can attack on the queen's wing.} 33. Qd3 Qa7 (33... Rxc4 34. Re1 Rb8 35. Rh2 Rd4 36. Qa3 d5 37. Bf5 Rdb4 38. Ree2 e4 $19) 34. Rdh1 Ra1+ ({Black wins quickly with} 34... Rb8 $1 $19) 35. Kc2 Qa4+ 36. Qb3 Qxb3+ (36... Bxc4 $19) 37. Kxb3 Rb8+ $19 38. Kc3 Ra2 39. Rb1 Rb4 40. b3 Ra3 (40... Bxc4 41. bxc4 Rxb1 42. Bxb1 e4+ 43. Kb3 Rb2+ $19) 41. Kc2 Ra2+ 42. Kc3 Re2 $2 {A mistake.} (42... d5 $19 43. cxd5 Bxg4 $19) 43. Ra1 $1 $11 {White counterattacks on the a file, and then on the 7th rank.} Re3+ 44. Kc2 Rexb3 45. Ra8+ Rb8 46. Ra7 Rb2+ 47. Kc1 R2b4 48. Rh7 Bf6 49. g7 Rxc4+ 50. Kd1 Rd4+ 51. Kc1 (51. Ke1 $2 Rxe4+ 52. fxe4 Kxh7 $19) 51... Rc4+ $11 {Perpetual check.} 52. Kd1 Rd4+ 53. Kc1 1/2-1/2

