1. d4 {Gligoric: I remember very little about the ten games which Bobby and I played, except that I won as White in the final game.  I think that Bobby had at least three wins. If I had kept my easily readable score-sheets, we would have no problems today, but after the match I gave them all to Bobby, without his asking, to show him that the material would never be used for any publicity purposes.} (1. Nf3 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 d6 5. d4) 1... Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. e4 O-O 5. Nf3 d6 6. Be2 e5 7. O-O Nc6 8. d5 Ne7 9. Ne1 Nd7 10. Be3 f5 11. f3 f4 12. Bf2 g5 13. Rc1 Ng6 $146 14. c5 Nxc5 {Une manoeuvre souvent jouée par Bobby dans ce match mais c'est intrinsèquement risqué car même en échangeant le bon  des Blancs, les Noirs affaiblissement leur position si les Blancs arrivent à jouer la poussée f2f4} (14... dxc5 15. b4 b6 16. Nd3) 15. b4 Na6 16. Nb5 Bd7 (16... h5 17. Nd3 (17. Nxa7 Bd7) 17... Bd7 (17... b6 18. Rc3 (18. Rc4) 18... Rf7 19. a4 Bf8 20. Be1 (20. Qb3 g4 21. Rfc1 Bh6) 20... Rg7 21. Rc4 Nh4 22. Nf2 Nb8 23. Qc2 Na6 24. h3)) (16... Bf6 17. Nxa7 (17. Qb3 b6 18. a4 (18. Rc3 Bb7 19. Nd3 Rf7 20. Rfc1) 18... h5 19. h3 Qd7 20. Nd3 Bg7 21. Rc4) 17... Nxb4 18. Qa4 b6 19. Bb5 Ba6 20. Qxb4 Rxa7 21. Bxa6 Rxa6 22. Qc4 Ra7) 17. a4 h5 18. Nd3 Bh6 19. Rc3 (19. Nxa7 g4 20. Kh1 (20. Nb5 g3 21. hxg3 fxg3 22. Bxg3 Bxc1 23. Qxc1 h4) 20... g3 21. Bg1 Rxa7 22. Bxa7 b6 23. Nf2 Qh4 24. Nh3 (24. h3) 24... Ra8 (24... Bxh3 25. gxh3 Qxh3 26. Rf2 gxf2) 25. Bxa6 Rxa7 26. Bb5 Bxh3 27. gxh3 Qxh3 28. Rc2 Nh4 29. Rg1) 19... Rf7 (19... b6 20. Be1 Rf7 21. Nf2 Nh4 (21... Nxb4 22. Nxc7) (21... Bc8 22. Rc4 (22. Qb3 Rg7 23. Bd2 Nh4 24. h3) 22... Nh4 (22... Nf8 23. Qc2 Nh7 24. Bd2 Nf6 25. Rc1 g4 26. Nxc7 Nxc7 27. Rxc7 Bd7 28. b5 Rg7 29. Qd1) (22... Rg7 23. Bd2 Nh4 24. h3 g4 25. fxg4 hxg4 26. Bxg4) 23. h3 Qf6 24. Qc2 g4) 22. Nxd6 cxd6 23. Bxa6 Qe8 24. Qe2 (24. b5 Qd8 (24... g4 25. fxg4 Rg7 26. Bb7 Rb8 27. Bc6 hxg4 28. Nxg4 Bxg4 29. Bxe8 Bxd1 30. Bxh4) 25. h3 Bg7 26. Nd3 Bf6 27. Nb4 g4 28. hxg4 hxg4 29. Bb7) 24... g4 25. fxg4 Nxg2 (25... Rg7 26. h3) 26. Kxg2 hxg4 27. Qc2 (27. Kg1 f3 28. Qc4 Bf4 (28... Rh7 29. Nh1) 29. Nh1 Bxh2+) 27... f3+ (27... Rh7 28. Bb5 (28. Nh1 Qh5) 28... Qh5 29. Bxd7) 28. Kg1 Bxa4 (28... Bf4 29. Bb5) (28... Rg7 29. Nh1) 29. Qd3 Rg7 (29... Bf4 30. Nxg4) 30. Nh1 Bf4 31. Rf2) 20. Nxa7 (20. Qd2 g4 21. Rfc1 Bg5) (20. Na3 Nb8 21. Qc2) 20... Nh4 (20... Rg7 21. Nb5 (21. b5 Nc5 22. Nxc5 dxc5 23. Rxc5 Rxa7 24. Rxc7) 21... Nf8 22. h3 Nh7 23. Be1 Nf6 24. Nf2 Nxb4 25. Rxc7 Na6 26. Rxb7 Nc5 27. Rc7 g4 28. fxg4 hxg4 29. Bxg4 Bxb5 30. Rxg7+ Kxg7 31. axb5 Qb6 32. Bf3) 21. Nb5 Rg7 22. Qe1 Kh7 23. Kh1 $1 {[%csl Rg7]} Ng6 24. Qd1 Nh4 25. Qe1 Ng6 26. h3 g4 {[%csl Re6]} 27. fxg4 $2 hxg4 $1 {[%cal Gd7h3,Gd8d6]} 28. Bxg4 Bxg4 29. hxg4 Qg5 $40 30. Qd1 Nh4 31. Ne1 Qxg4 32. Qxg4 Rxg4 33. Nxc7 Rc8 34. Nb5 Rxc3 35. Nxc3 Nxb4 $19 36. Nf3 Nxf3 37. gxf3 Rg7 38. Nb5 Rd7 39. Bb6 Bf8 40. Rc1 Na6 41. Rc8 Kg7 42. Kg2 Be7 43. Kh3 Kf6 44. Kg4 Nb4 45. Nc7 Nd3 46. Ne6 Nc5 {[%cal Gc3e4,Ge4f6]} 47. Bxc5 dxc5 48. a5 Bd6 {[%cal Ge5b2,Gc3e4]} 49. Kh3 Rh7+ 50. Kg2 Ke7 51. Nxc5 Rg7+ $1 52. Kf2 Bxc5+ {[%cal Gd2e4,Ge4f6]} 53. Rxc5 $5 Kd6 54. Rb5 Rh7 55. Rb1 Rh2+ 56. Kg1 $44 Ra2 57. Rxb7 Rxa5 58. Rb3 Ra2 59. Rc3 Ra6 60. Rc8 Kd7 $13 61. Rc2 $142 Kd6 62. Kf2 Kd7 63. Ke2 Rh6 64. Kd3 Rh3 65. Rf2 Kd6 66. Kc4 Rh1 67. Rg2 Rc1+ 68. Kd3 Rd1+ 69. Ke2 Ra1 70. Rg5 Ra2+ 71. Kd3 Rf2 72. Kc4 Rc2+ 73. Kd3 Rf2 74. Rg6+ Kc5 75. Rc6+ Kb5 76. Re6 Rxf3+ 77. Kd2 {Danielian,O-Brenjo,S (2320)/Leningrad 1991/CBM 023 ext/½-½ (50)} Kc4 {La grande ligne} 78. Rxe5 Kd4 79. Re8 Rf2+ 80. Ke1 Ra2 81. Rb8 Ke3 82. Rb3+ Kxe4 83. d6 Ra6 84. d7 Rd6 85. Rb4+ Kf3 86. Rb3+ Kg4 87. Kf1 Rxd7 88. Ra3 Rb7 89. Kf2 Rb2+ 90. Kf1 0-1

