 bxc3 bxc3 37. Be1 Ba3 38. Rc2 {Remisvorschlag von Fischer Zeit: W 2.03 S 2.26} Nb4 { c3, d5 = Suetin} 39. h4 $4 Nxc2 $19 40. Bxc2 $4 Rb6 $19 41. f5 $4 Rb2 $19 {Alle Kurzvarianten Korchnoi} 42. Qa6 $10 {Suetin} Qf8 43. fxg6 hxg6 44. h5 gxh5 45. Qa5 Bd6 46. Qf5 Rc6 47. Qxe4 Rxc2 48. Rxc2 Qc8 49. Qh4 Qf5 50. e4 Qf3 $1 51. Qg5+ Kf8 52. Qd8+ Kg7 $10 {Suetin} 1/2-1/2

