1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. a3 Bxc3+ 5. bxc3 dxe4 6. Qg4 Nf6 7. Qxg7 Rg8 8. Qh6 Rg6 9. Qe3 Nc6 $6 (9... b6 $5 10. Ne2 Bb7 11. Nf4 Rg8 12. Bb2 Nbd7 $132) 10. Bb2 (10. Ne2 Ne7 11. Nf4 Ned5 $15 {(Keres 69, eco 74/81)}) 10... Qd6 {Uhlmann (Sokolov 70)} (10... Ne7 11. c4 $5 b6 12. Ne2 Bb7 13. Nf4 $132 {(Gligoric 75)}) (10... e5 11. O-O-O Qe7 12. h3 a6 13. d5 $6 Nb8 14. Ne2 Nbd7 15. Ng3 Nc5 $15 {(Euwe 81) Fichtl-Bartosek Vimperk 1951}) 11. f3 $1 {"The correct idea, eliminating the KP and thus increasing the scope of his bishops." (Gligoric 75)} (11. c4 $5 e5 12. d5 {(Vukovic 35)}) 11... exf3 $6 (11... e5 $5 12. fxe4 exd4 13. cxd4 Nxe4 14. O-O-O f5 $13 {(Vukovic, Sokolov 70, Zeuthen/Jarlnaes 71, eco 74/81, Gligoric 75, Levy 75, Euwe 81)} (14... Re6 15. d5) (14... Bf5 15. g4 Rxg4 16. Bh3)) 12. Nxf3 Bd7 13. O-O-O O-O-O 14. c4 $1 $16 {(Sokolov 70, eco 74/81, Mednis 74, Euwe 81)} Ng4 15. Qd2 f5 16. d5 $1 $16 {(Marovic/Susic 75)} Nb8 (16... exd5 $2 17. cxd5 Ne7 18. h3 Nf6 19. Ne5 $1 {(Gligoric 75)}) (16... Nce5 17. Nxe5 Nxe5 18. Qd4 {(Sokolov 70)} Nf7 19. Qxa7) (16... Ne7 17. h3 Nf6 18. Nh4 Ne4 19. Qd4 {(Levy 75)}) 17. h3 Nf6 18. Ne5 $1 (18. Nh4 Ne4 19. Qe3 Qg3 {(Levy 76)}) 18... Ne4 19. Qd4 Rg3 $2 (19... Rgg8 $142 20. Qxa7 (20. Nf7 $6 Qf4+ 21. Kb1 Rdf8 22. dxe6 Bxe6 {(Gligoric 75)}) 20... b6 {(Gligoric 75)}) 20. Nf7 $1 Qf4+ 21. Kb1 c5 (21... Rf8 $2 22. dxe6 $18) 22. Qe5 $1 $18 Qxe5 23. Bxe5 Rdg8 (23... Rf8 24. Nd6+ Nxd6 25. Bxd6 $18 {(Levy 75)}) 24. Bd3 $1 Rxg2 25. Bxe4 fxe4 26. Nd6+ Kc7 27. Nxe4+ Kb6 28. Nf6 $1 Ba4 29. Nxg8 Bxc2+ 30. Kc1 Nd7 31. Rdg1 $1 1-0

